---

<DocsLayout
  title="Loomey"
  description="Track books, reading sessions, goals, streaks, stats, EPUBs, sprints, buddies, bingos, challenges, and more in one connected reading companion with Loomey."
>
  <main class="loomey-page">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-copy reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">Meet Loomey</p>

        <h1>Build a reading life that remembers more than the last page you turned.</h1>

        <p class="hero-text">
          Loomey is a reading companion built around the full life of your books.
          Organize your library, log reading sessions, follow goals and streaks,
          review detailed statistics and history, read imported EPUBs, join focused
          sprints, connect with reading buddies, complete bingo boards and challenges,
          and keep your profile, settings, and reading progress tied together.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions" aria-label="Loomey links">
          <a class="primary-button raised-button" href="#features">
            Explore Features
          </a>

          <a class="secondary-button raised-button" href="/contact">
            Contact Support
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-showcase reveal reveal-delay">
        <div class="showcase-card main-card">
          <span class="mini-label">Your Reading Life in Loomey</span>

          <h4>Books, sessions, goals, stats, and reading experiences stay connected.</h4>

          <div class="progress-line">
            <span></span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="floating-card floating-card-one">
          <span>Reading Progress</span>
          <strong>Sessions, streaks, goals, and history</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="floating-card floating-card-two">
          <span>Your Library</span>
          <strong>Books, EPUBs, notes, and reading details</strong>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <GradientDivider />

    <section class="intro-section reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">One Connected Reading System</p>

      <h2>Your books, goals, sessions, history, and reading community should not feel like separate apps.</h2>

      <p>
        Loomey brings your library, reading sessions, progress, goals, statistics,
        goal history, EPUBs, sprints, buddies, bingos, challenges, profile, and
        settings into one reading system. The things you do while reading stay
        connected to the books and progress they belong to instead of becoming
        isolated records you have to reconstruct later.
      </p>
    </section>

